bb 4,14:1 \u2014 OK en desktop (24 px gras = grand texte),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0insuffisant en mobile (18 px gras < 18,7 px) (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : paragraphe 5,39:1, \u00ab Great \u00bb et \u00ab 76 \u00bb blancs, Continue 11,06:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4nes de cat\u00e9gorie : d\u00e9coratives (le nom suit) \u2192 alt=\"\".", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1515465106, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : Reaction 2,93:1, Memory 1,76:1, Verbal 2,32:1 sur leur fond teint\u00e9\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(Visual 8,58:1 OK) (Q-A1) \u00b7 \u00ab / 100 \u00bb gris 3,12:1 (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant : \u00ab of 100 \u00bb lavande \u00e0 50 % sur le cercle 2,51:1 (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Limite : \u00ab Your Result \u00bb 4,14:1 \u2014 OK en desktop (24 px gras = grand texte),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0insuffisant en mobile (18 px gras < 18,7 px) (Q-A2)\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : paragraphe 5,39:1, \u00ab Great \u00bb et \u00ab 76 \u00bb blancs, Continue 11,06:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4nes de cat\u00e9gorie : d\u00e9coratives (le nom suit) \u2192 alt=\"\".", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881759637, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1869883292, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rs-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 52980, "y": 2579, "width": 2520, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0bM", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 670244643, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793881759638, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1650925593}, {"id": "rs-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 53000, "y": 2599, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0bN", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1555795280, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881759638, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1521136954, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rs-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 53000, "y": 2643, "width": 2480, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0bO", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Noms de cat\u00e9gorie trop clairs. (Texte plus fonc\u00e9, m\u00eame teinte : Reaction hsl(0, 100%, 44%) 4,7:1 \u00b7 Memory hsl(39, 100%, 31%) 4,6:1 \u00b7 Verbal hsl(166, 100%, 25%) 4,7:1 ; ic\u00f4nes inchang\u00e9es.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab / 100 \u00bb, \u00ab of 100 \u00bb et \u00ab Your Result \u00bb (mobile) sous 4,5:1. (\u00ab / 100 \u00bb hsl(224, 10%, 45%) 4,9:1 ; \u00ab of 100 \u00bb Light lavender plein 4,5:1 ; \u00ab Your Result \u00bb lavande plus claire hsl(241, 100%, 95%) 4,6:1.)\nQ-A3\u00a0\u00a0Focus non dessin\u00e9. (Contour 2 px d\u00e9cal\u00e9 de 2 px sur Continue et les liens.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0data.json fourni \u00ab pour pratiquer le JS \u00bb. (Contenu \u00e9crit dans le HTML : c'est un challenge HTML et CSS ; pas de JavaScript.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Continue \u00bb n'a pas de destination. (button type=\"button\" sans action, comme le composant dessin\u00e9.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte desktop centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 768 px ; en dessous, la disposition mobile.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 604093176, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Noms de cat\u00e9gorie trop clairs. (Texte plus fonc\u00e9, m\u00eame teinte : Reaction hsl(0, 100%, 44%) 4,7:1 \u00b7 Memory hsl(39, 100%, 31%) 4,6:1 \u00b7 Verbal hsl(166, 100%, 25%) 4,7:1 ; ic\u00f4nes inchang\u00e9es.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab / 100 \u00bb, \u00ab of 100 \u00bb et \u00ab Your Result \u00bb (mobile) sous 4,5:1. (\u00ab / 100 \u00bb hsl(224, 10%, 45%) 4,9:1 ; \u00ab of 100 \u00bb Light lavender plein 4,5:1 ; \u00ab Your Result \u00bb lavande plus claire hsl(241, 100%, 95%) 4,6:1.)\nQ-A3\u00a0\u00a0Focus non dessin\u00e9. (Contour 2 px d\u00e9cal\u00e9 de 2 px sur Continue et les liens.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0data.json fourni \u00ab pour pratiquer le JS \u00bb. (Contenu \u00e9crit dans le HTML : c'est un challenge HTML et CSS ; pas de JavaScript.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Continue \u00bb n'a pas de destination. (button type=\"button\" sans action, comme le composant dessin\u00e9.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte desktop centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 768 px ; en dessous, la disposition mobile.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881759638, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 218579540, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"rs-img-d-file": {"id": "rs-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881743436}, "rs-img-m-file": {"id": "rs-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881743436}}}